# Every text file is committed with LF and checked out with LF on every host (the Windows host lane runs the
# tests on a checkout; the source-entry test and prettier assume LF). Binary fixtures are marked so, and the
# graph-io import corpora keep their own line endings (four of them are CRLF on purpose).
* text=auto eol=lf
packages/graph-io/test/corpus/** -text
*.gsnp binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
